00:15:17.625 --> 00:15:21.086
Right as you get to the final seconds of light,
before the eclipse

00:15:21.086 --> 00:15:24.798
and you just get it's a Bailey's beads,
where you just get a single point of light,

00:15:24.798 --> 00:15:27.384
or just a few points of light
