of varying temperature and densities.

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:34.850
Each of the boundaries
between those layers of air

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:37.436
refract the light, bending it
this way and that.

00:15:37.436 --> 00:15:40.272
This is actually the same effect
